  "description": "The third iteration of Retrospec's Amok fuses technical sophistication with unrivaled agility. Our 8-speed urban warrior is a gravel bike by design, but we’ve constructed it to be the ideal commuting companion, too. Its 6061 aluminum frame will carry you far ahead of any adversaries. Trek across road and dirt alike on dual purpose 700x40C Innova tires, specially designed to tackle both off-road and urban conditions. We’ve included our own Retrospec Low-Profile BMX pedals to withstand tough riding. The cable routing is on the top of the top tube for easy transporting. Amok V3 is equipped with a Shimano Acera 8-speed derailleur and a Shimano Rapid Fire thumb shifter for effortless shifting even in challenging conditions. The Tektro mechanical disc brakes provide powerful fade-free stopping power come rain or shine. Our race-ready geometry will transport you up and down dirt trails and around the asphalted streets of your urban jungle, no questions asked.",
